<!--
    More events for the vanilla Slug sectors. See sector_data.xml.append.
-->

<eventList name="XFTL_MORE_SLUG">
	<event load="XFTL_SLUG_PSYCHIC"/>
	<event load="XFTL_SLUG_INSURANCE"/>
	<event load="XFTL_SLUG_SPA"/>
	<event load="XFTL_SLUG_MAP_SELLER"/>
</eventList>

<event name="XFTL_SLUG_PSYCHIC">
	<text>A Slug fortune teller offers to read your future, for a small fee. "I see... a great fleet behind you, and a greater ship ahead."</text>
	<environment type="nebula"/>
	<choice>
		<text>Pay for the reading.</text>
		<event load="XFTL_SLUG_PSYCHIC_OUTCOME"/>
	</choice>
	<choice req="slug" hidden="true">
		<text>(Slug Crew) Have your Slug read the fortune teller's mind instead.</text>
		<event>
			<text>Your Slug learns that the "fortune teller" is a pirate scout, and where its friends hide their loot.</text>
			<autoReward level="MED">standard</autoReward>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice>
		<text>No thanks.</text>
		<event/>
	</choice>
</event>
<eventList name="XFTL_SLUG_PSYCHIC_OUTCOME">
	<event>
		<text>The Slug's "visions" turn out to be a remarkably accurate map of the sector.</text>
		<item_modify>
			<item type="scrap" min="-10" max="-10"/>
		</item_modify>
		<reveal_map/>
	</event>
	<event>
		<text>The Slug tells you nothing useful, and takes your scrap.</text>
		<item_modify>
			<item type="scrap" min="-10" max="-10"/>
		</item_modify>
	</event>
</eventList>

<event name="XFTL_SLUG_INSURANCE">
	<text>A Slug salesman offers you "hull insurance". "Pay me now, and if anything bad happens to your ship, I'll make it right."</text>
	<environment type="nebula"/>
	<choice>
		<text>Buy the insurance.</text>
		<event load="XFTL_SLUG_INSURANCE_OUTCOME"/>
	</choice>
	<choice>
		<text>Decline.</text>
		<event>
			<text>"Your loss. Literally." The salesman leaves.</text>
		</event>
	</choice>
</event>
<eventList name="XFTL_SLUG_INSURANCE_OUTCOME">
	<event>
		<text>The salesman takes your scrap, and sends a repair drone over to patch up your hull. It's actually a fair deal.</text>
		<item_modify>
			<item type="scrap" min="-20" max="-20"/>
		</item_modify>
		<damage amount="-5"/>
	</event>
	<event>
		<text>The salesman takes your scrap and vanishes into the nebula. You check the fine print: you're insured against Slug attacks only.</text>
		<item_modify>
			<item type="scrap" min="-20" max="-20"/>
		</item_modify>
	</event>
</eventList>

<event name="XFTL_SLUG_SPA">
	<text>A Slug-run spa station offers rest and relaxation for weary crews. Their prices are outrageous, but your crew look exhausted.</text>
	<environment type="nebula"/>
	<choice>
		<text>Give your crew some shore leave.</text>
		<event load="XFTL_SLUG_SPA_OUTCOME"/>
	</choice>
	<choice>
		<text>No time for that.</text>
		<event/>
	</choice>
</event>
<eventList name="XFTL_SLUG_SPA_OUTCOME">
	<event>
		<text>Your crew come back refreshed. While they were away, one of the spa's staff decided to sign up with you.</text>
		<item_modify>
			<item type="scrap" min="-15" max="-15"/>
		</item_modify>
		<crewMember amount="1" class="slug"/>
	</event>
	<event>
		<text>Your crew come back refreshed, and much poorer.</text>
		<item_modify>
			<item type="scrap" min="-25" max="-25"/>
		</item_modify>
	</event>
</eventList>

<event name="XFTL_SLUG_MAP_SELLER">
	<text>A Slug offers to sell you the location of a "secret pirate treasure" hidden in this sector.</text>
	<environment type="nebula"/>
	<choice>
		<text>Buy the location.</text>
		<event load="XFTL_SLUG_MAP_SELLER_OUTCOME"/>
	</choice>
	<choice>
		<text>Decline.</text>
		<event/>
	</choice>
</event>
<eventList name="XFTL_SLUG_MAP_SELLER_OUTCOME">
	<event>
		<text>The treasure is real, though smaller than promised.</text>
		<item_modify>
			<item type="scrap" min="-15" max="-15"/>
		</item_modify>
		<autoReward level="MED">stuff</autoReward>
	</event>
	<event>
		<text>The "treasure" is guarded by the pirates who own it. The Slug forgot to mention that.</text>
		<item_modify>
			<item type="scrap" min="-15" max="-15"/>
		</item_modify>
		<ship load="PIRATE" hostile="true"/>
	</event>
</eventList>
